      "text": "A man allegedly stabbed his wife and mother-in-law to death and seriously injured his father-in-law here on the intervening night of Saturday and Sunday, police said.\n\nBallia SP Omvir Singh said a domestic dispute between the accused and his wife is suspected to be the trigger behind the attack, adding that three teams have been formed to arrest the accused, identified as Amit Kumar Gupta.\n\nCatch the complete story 🔗 \nhttps://www.hindustantimes.com/india-news/domestic-dispute-turns-deadly-as-man-slits-throats-of-wife-her-mother-in-up-101777185127567.html",
